      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where each rule lives — the pointer index",
      "prov:value": "Moved here 2026-10-09 from the checkout root's `AGENTS.md`, which is now a rendered file (owner: *\"these should be rendrederd files\"*). What it carried that a skill already says was dropped; what follows is the pointer, plus the facts about THIS layer that no skill states. The original is kept verbatim on the `fsh-guts` state branch (`separated/root-AGENTS.md`).",
